      "date": "2026-05-30T20:28:25.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹26.66 (vs ₹23.90 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹26.66 (up from ₹23.90 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹24.9b (down 4.4% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹615.0m (up 12% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 2.5% (up from 2.1% in FY 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 40% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 15% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
