      "title": "Goodyear India Limited Recommends Final Dividend for the Financial Year Ended March 31, 2026",
      "body": "Goodyear India Limited at its board meeting held on May 28, 2026 recommended a Final Dividend of INR 26.50 per equity share of INR 10 each, for the Financial Year ended March 31, 2026. The Final Dividend, if approved by the members, at the forthcoming Annual General Meeting scheduled to be held on August 12, 2026 shall be paid within the statutory time limit to those members whose names would appear in the Register of members on August 05, 2026.",
